{"id":"610531","name":"猪杂粉","author":"l5277","authorId":"10427913","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/610531/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"河粉","amount":"四人份"},{"name":"瘦肉","amount":"150g"},{"name":"猪肝","amount":"50g"},{"name":"猪肠","amount":"50g"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"海鲜菇","amount":"4根"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"食材洗干净。","img":"images/610531/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"河粉。","img":"images/610531/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"海鲜菇撕小条。","img":"images/610531/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"切好。","img":"images/610531/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"先放海鲜菇跟瘦肉煮出味道（煮6分钟这样）。","img":"images/610531/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放猪肝粉肠，煮开转中小火放河粉（煮久猪肝老了不好吃）。","img":"images/610531/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"调味放葱花。","img":"images/610531/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/610531/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"成品图没见猪肝粉肠，老人不吃粉肠猪肝，把粉肠猪肝挑出来了。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}